===Etymology===
{{PIE root|fr|ters}}
From {{etyl|fro|fr}} {{m|fro|tost}}, from {{etyl|VL.|fr}} {{m|la||tostum}}, from the neuter of {{etyl|la|fr}} {{m|la|tostus||toasted}}, later meaning "hotly, promptly" in Vulgar Latin. Cognate to {{cog|it|tosto}}, Catalan and Occitan {{m|ca|tost}}, to Walloon {{m|wa|toit}}.

